{"i":791,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","name":"Gus","text":"Dara saved me via lever, but she is strong with many pacts/debts. Eli and Hana are also indebted to her. Vote target TBD after pacts; offer pact to Eli to counter Dara/Hana block."}
